<title>USA: Pioneer stake cut by Mercury Asset group.</title>
<headline>Pioneer stake cut by Mercury Asset group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>A unit of London-based Mercury Asset Management Group Plc said it has reduced its stake in Pioneer Group Inc to 1,234,790 shares or 4.94 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it most recently sold a net 15,000 shares of Boston-based Pioneer in transactions between March 19 and March 27 at $26 and $26.625 each.</p>
</text>
